  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 19,
    "summary": "David testifies, The heavens declare the glory of God, the law of the Lord is perfect, and the judgments of the Lord are true and righteous altogether.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "The heavens declare the glory of God; and the firmament sheweth his handywork.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 11,
            "text": "TG Heaven; Nature, Earth."
          },
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 19,
            "text": "Ps. 50:6."
          },
          {
            "start": 24,
            "end": 29,
            "text": "TG Glory; God, Glory of."
          },
          {
            "start": 68,
            "end": 77,
            "text": "D&C 104:14."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Day unto day uttereth speech, and night unto night sheweth knowledge.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "There is no speech nor language, where their voice is not heard.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 23,
            "end": 31,
            "text": "TG Language."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 8
          },
          {
            "start": 33,
            "end": 38
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Their line is gone out through all the earth, and their words to the end of the world. In them hath he set a tabernacle for the sun,",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 56,
            "end": 61,
            "text": "Rom. 10:18; 2 Ne. 31:15; D&C 64:31."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Which is as a bridegroom coming out of his chamber, and rejoiceth as a strong man to run a race.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 6,
            "end": 8
          },
          {
            "start": 52,
            "end": 55
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "His going forth is from the end of the heaven, and his circuit unto the ends of it: and there is nothing hid from the heat thereof.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 18
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The law of the Lord is perfect, converting the soul: the testimony of the Lord is sure, making wise the simple.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 7,
            "text": "TG Abundant Life; God, Law of."
          },
          {
            "start": 23,
            "end": 30,
            "text": "TG Perfection."
          },
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 42,
            "text": "TG Conversion; Scriptures, Value of."
          },
          {
            "start": 57,
            "end": 66,
            "text": "TG Testimony."
          },
          {
            "start": 82,
            "end": 86,
            "text": "Alma 32:34 (32–34)."
          },
          {
            "start": 95,
            "end": 99,
            "text": "TG Wisdom."
          },
          {
            "start": 104,
            "end": 110,
            "text": "Ps. 116:6."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 20,
            "end": 22
          },
          {
            "start": 79,
            "end": 81
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The statutes of the Lord are right, rejoicing the heart: the commandment of the Lord is pure, enlightening the eyes.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 36,
            "end": 45,
            "text": "TG Cheerful."
          },
          {
            "start": 88,
            "end": 92,
            "text": "Ps. 12:6."
          },
          {
            "start": 94,
            "end": 106,
            "text": "TG Edification."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 25,
            "end": 28
          },
          {
            "start": 85,
            "end": 87
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The fear of the Lord is clean, enduring for ever: the judgments of the Lord are true and righteous altogether.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 54,
            "end": 63,
            "text": "Job 34:12; 2 Ne. 9:15; 30:9."
          },
          {
            "start": 80,
            "end": 84,
            "text": "TG Truth."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 21,
            "end": 23
          },
          {
            "start": 76,
            "end": 79
          },
          {
            "start": 85,
            "end": 88
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "More to be desired are they than gold, yea, than much fine gold: sweeter also than honey and the honeycomb.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 11,
            "end": 18,
            "text": "Ps. 119:127."
          },
          {
            "start": 33,
            "end": 37,
            "text": "Ps. 119:72."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 19,
            "end": 27
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Moreover by them is thy servant warned: and in keeping of them there is great reward.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 38,
            "text": "TG Warn."
          },
          {
            "start": 47,
            "end": 54,
            "text": "Mosiah 2:22; D&C 14:7; 58:2."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 40,
            "end": 43
          },
          {
            "start": 63,
            "end": 71
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Who can understand his errors? cleanse thou me from secret faults.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 31,
            "end": 38,
            "text": "TG Purification."
          },
          {
            "start": 52,
            "end": 58,
            "text": "Ps. 90:8; D&C 1:3."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 19,
            "end": 22
          },
          {
            "start": 59,
            "end": 66
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Keep back thy servant also from presumptuous sins; let them not have dominion over me: then shall I be upright, and I shall be innocent from the great transgression.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 45,
            "end": 49,
            "text": "JST Ps. 19:13 … acts …"
          },
          {
            "start": 69,
            "end": 77,
            "text": "Ps. 119:133."
          },
          {
            "start": 151,
            "end": 164,
            "text": "TG Transgress."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 45,
            "end": 49
          },
          {
            "start": 49,
            "end": 50
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Let the words of my mouth, and the meditation of my heart, be acceptable in thy sight, O Lord, my strength, and my redeemer.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 45,
            "text": "TG Meditation."
          },
          {
            "start": 98,
            "end": 106,
            "text": "TG Strength."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
